# Scripts and container files execute on Linux. Force LF regardless of the
# checkout platform: with CRLF the shebang reads as "bash\r", which is not a
# program, and the script fails with a confusing "No such file or directory".
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# Never let git rewrite these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
